NOVA original-source license: OWNER APPROVAL PENDING

This file records a release-preparation decision, not an open-source license.
No new license grant is made by this draft. Do not publish this preparation
branch as a licensed open-source release until the owner approves a license.

MIT is proposed for the original NOVA code, documentation and graphics.
The proposed text is in LICENSES/MIT-proposed.txt; scope and alternatives are
explained in docs/LICENSING.md. Existing local MIT labels are draft metadata
and have not been treated as owner approval.

Third-party material retains its own terms. The RAR fixture is CC0-1.0;
see tests/fixtures/rar/README.md and LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt. Fedora, Linux, Qt,
KDE, bootc and other dependencies are not relicensed by NOVA.
